  {
   "mode": "section",
   "target": "overview.md",
   "section": "What this is",
   "body": "Natural Backwalls Everywhere is an Oxygen Not Included mod that gives every biome the natural backwall tiles the Aquatic Planet Pack places behind its own biomes. Each biome gets a configurable material chosen from that biome's own solids and a configurable coverage, and each subworld zone picks the noise pattern its backwall patches follow. It works on new worlds only: backwalls are written during world generation, by adding the pack's `backwallNoise` and `<biome>_backwall` band data to every other subworld and biome on the per-world copy of the worldgen settings. It does not need the Aquatic Planet Pack; it ships its own copies of the pack's four noise trees. Version 0.3.0 is on the Steam Workshop (id 3816744732); the README marks it work in progress, with defaults still being tuned. `mod_info.yaml` sets `supportedContent: ALL` and `minimumSupportedBuild: 744825`. Available in English, Chinese (Simplified), Korean and Russian."
  }
